        <abstract>
            <para>The Coastal Carolina University Herbarium is a newly revived herbarium and an important part of the Department of Biological Sciences at Coastal Carolina. Total holdings are just over 7,000 vascular plant specimens collected mainly in the Southeastern United States.</para>
